flowchart LR
    A[Browser Request] --> B{Is Token Auth or Server-to-Server?}
    B -- Yes --> K[Bypass CORS and CSRF]
    B -- No --> C{Is Cross-Origin?}

    C -- Yes --> D[CORS Middleware Check]
    D --> E{Origin Allowed?}
    E -- No --> F[Browser Blocks Request]
    E -- Yes --> G{Is Session Auth Write?}
    C -- No --> G

    G -- Yes --> H[CSRF Middleware Check]
    H --> I{Token Valid?}
    I -- No --> J[403 CSRF Error]
    I -- Yes --> L[Request Proceeds to View]
    G -- No --> L